From aa8a736ff2489a8019f0440938c877128a1af26c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ramprasad <ramprasadgoud34@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:40:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat(contracts): silver and platinum on a per-metal bank
 issuer with an asset registry

BankMetalIssuer is BankGoldIssuer generalised: one token, certificate registry,
EIP-712 domain, purity floor, reserve invariant and pause switch per metal.
Gold keeps its reviewed BankGoldIssuer unchanged. AssetRegistry lists every
metal and checks token and issuer are bound to each other.
